        "mediæval"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "\"Middle Ages\" used with capitals, passim; \"mediæval\" also frequent, with the same sense, but seems to be used slightly more generically in the section dealing with the proposed periodization" ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0367jz> ;
    skos:note "\"If we think of this purely mediæval section as beginning with Karl the Great about the year 800 and ending with Dante about 1300...\" page 64" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Middle Ages" ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "about 1300" ;
