    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p05hrsf> ;
    skos:note "From \"A description of a new chart of History\", 6th. ed, 1786, , s.v. \"Indostan\", pp. 82-83: \"In 1001 Mahmud Gazni made considerable conquests in [Indostan]... in 1383 Timur Bek conquered Candahar. In 1396 he invaded the rest of India, and in 1399 he entered Delhi the capital of it, conquering the remains of Mahmud Gazni's empire.\"" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Gasnevides" ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "1383 to 1399" ;
