Ending dates of 1770 derived from the year of publication, and also the point at which the chart ends.

Spatial coverage derived from the extent of the Spanish empire in North America as of 1819, including Alta California, New Mexico, and Texas: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Viceroyalty_of_New_Spain_Location_1819_(without_Philippines).png.""" ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p05hrsf> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Spanish Mexico" ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "1770" ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "1770"^^xsd:gYear ] ] ;
    time:intervalStartedBy [ skos:prefLabel "1521" ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "1521"^^xsd:gYear ] ] .

