<http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p06tnbvtdjr> a skos:Concept ;
    periodo:spatialCoverageDescription "Greater Chiriqui" ;
    dcelements:language "en" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-1/en> ;
    dcterms:source [ bibo:locator "p. 237" ] ;
    dcterms:spatial <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q800>,
        <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q804> ;
    skos:altLabel "Boquete phase"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p06tnbv> ;
    skos:note "The Boquete lithic assemblage “stratigraphically overlies the Talamanca phase at the Casita de Piedra and Trapiche rockshelters (Ranere 1975b: 176-77). The single C14 date, slightly later than 3000 B.C. when adjusted, came from the top of layer D at Casita de Piedra and either antedates the Boquete phase or reflects its very beginning (Linares and Ranere 1971: 350). The end should be around 1000 B.C., since SI-1844 is said to date the transition to the following ceramic phase at Casita de Piedra. Boquete represents a gradual development out of the Talamanca phase.” (p. 237)" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Boquete phase" ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "around 1000 B.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "-0999"^^xsd:gYear ] ] ;
    time:intervalStartedBy [ skos:prefLabel "slightly later than 3000 B.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "-2999"^^xsd:gYear ] ] .

<http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p06tnbvxq74> a skos:Concept ;
    periodo:spatialCoverageDescription "Greater Chiriqui" ;
    dcelements:language "en" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-1/en> ;
    dcterms:source [ bibo:locator "p. 236" ] ;
    dcterms:spatial <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q800>,
        <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q804> ;
    skos:altLabel "Talamanca phase"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p06tnbv> ;
    skos:note "The older of the two preceramic phases, Talamanca, has been dated by Ranere (1975b: 177) to before 3000 B.C., while Cooke (1976a:22) suggested a dating between 5000 and 3000 B.C. Taking the corrected C14 dates into account, 6000 to 3000 B.C. seems appropriate.” (p. 236)" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Talamanca phase" ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "3000 B.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "-2999"^^xsd:gYear ] ] ;
    time:intervalStartedBy [ skos:prefLabel "6000 B.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "-5999"^^xsd:gYear ] ] .

