    skos:note "\"The middle Historic subperiod, when much of the record on aboriginal peoples is in reference to remnants of native groups living in the Spanish missions, began in about 1730 and ended in about 1800 as the mission system was failing (Hester 1989a, 1989b)\" (p. 124)." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Middle Historic" ;
