    skos:note "Term not used in its own right, instead see narrower terms.  Term used to describe the period and material culture of south-western Iran between circa 3000-539 BC which was referred to as the land of Elam in ancient Mesopotamian sources. Elamite is also an ancient language spoken in this region at that time." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Elamite" ;
