    skos:altLabel "The Seleucid Era"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "Inferred from the following discussions: page 30 states that Seleucus I declared the official Year 1 of the Seleucid Era to be 311 BCE; Figure 1 on page 6 indicates the final Seleucid king, Philip II Barypous, ended his reign in 64 BCE; and page 234 explicitly states the dissolution of the Seleukid kingdom by Pompey in 64 BCE." ;
