    skos:editorialNote "The start date range is provided by the explanation in the text on p. 38 and the start date of 250 B.P. in the chart on p. 11 (and by extension in the end-date of the Late Prehistoric period in the text). The end date is inferred from the fact that the article focuses on radiocarbon dates and understands 1950 as the \"present\" in \"B.P.\"." ;
