<http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0mrv3s6r78> a skos:Concept ;
    periodo:spatialCoverageDescription "Pompeii" ;
    dcelements:language "it" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-1/it> ;
    dcterms:source [ dcterms:isPartOf <http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/600657650> ;
            bibo:locator "page 88-89" ] ;
    dcterms:spatial <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q38> ;
    skos:altLabel "I periodo "@it ;
    skos:editorialNote """This period refers to the chronology of Roman building and translates to "Period I". Mauri derives this periodization from Mau (http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrfg8cc), preferring it to Fiorelli's periodization (http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/6411737): "...more complete is the Mau which divided the Pompeian building into main phases: Period I - corresponding to the 6th century BC."  (pages 88-89) 
This period is followed by a second building period, also from Mau (http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrf), which does not have explicit dates, but an end around the time of the Second Punic War. (page 89)

 Maiuri provides a disclaimer about Mau's dating of the pre-Samnite and Samnite Periods, offering a more cautious approach to dating based on material: "Even this classification of the Mau is no longer adheres to reality and in the light of new discoveries, especially with regard to the pre-Samnite Period which presents itself with a more complex variety and with materials so far not yet known, such as in soft tufa, first used alone and then together with limestone. Secondly, not all the limestone atrium houses can be considered today to be of the of the Samnite Age." (page 90)

""" ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0mrv3s> ;
    skos:note """"più completo il Mau che suddivise l'edilizia pompeiana in fasi principali: I periodo - corrispondente al VI secolo a.C." (pages 88-89)

"Anche questa classificazione del Mau non è ormai più aderente alla realtà e alla luce della nuove scoperte, sopratutto riguardo al periodo pre-sannitico che ci si presenta con una varietà più complessa e con materiali finora non ancora conosciuti, quali in tufo tenero, usato dapprima da solo e poi insieme calcare. In secondo luogo non tutte le case ad atrio calcareo possono considerarsi oggi d'età sannitica." (page 90)
""" ;
    skos:prefLabel "I periodo " ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "VI secolo a.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "-0500"^^xsd:gYear ] ] ;
    time:intervalStartedBy [ skos:prefLabel "VI secolo a.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "-0599"^^xsd:gYear ] ] .

<http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0mrv3s7n99> a skos:Concept ;
    periodo:spatialCoverageDescription "Pompeii" ;
    dcelements:language "it" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-1/it> ;
    dcterms:source [ dcterms:isPartOf <http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/600657650> ;
            bibo:locator "page 89" ] ;
    dcterms:spatial <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q38> ;
    skos:altLabel "5° periodo "@it ;
    skos:editorialNote """"Fifth Period" is derived from Mau's building period (http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrfcw9r), though Mau's period allows for several decades before the fall of the Republic for the start date of this period: "...more complete is the Mau which divided the Pompeian building into main phases."(pages 88-89)
"From 27 BC to the earthquake of 63 AD. The reticulated technique is characteristic. It is the period of the second and third and the beginning of the fourth style of wall painting." (page 89)" This refers to Mau's painting periods http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrfz36p, http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrf8ccs, and http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrf63k3. """ ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0mrv3s> ;
    skos:note "\"...più completo il Mau che suddivise l'edilizia pompeiana in fasi principali.\" (pages 88-89) \"Dal 27 a.C. al terremoto del 63 d.C. Caratteristica la tecnica del reticolato. È il periodo coevo del II e III e dell'inizio del IV stile della pittura parietale.\" (page 89)" ;
    skos:prefLabel "5° periodo " ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "63 d.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "0063"^^xsd:gYear ] ] ;
    time:intervalStartedBy [ skos:prefLabel "27 a.C." ;
            time:hasDateTimeDescription [ time:year "-0026"^^xsd:gYear ] ] .

