        "II Fase"@it ;
    skos:editorialNote """Translates to "Phase III" and "Tufa Age." Start date is derived from the date Maiuri provides for the First Samnite Period and end date is derived from the date for the Third Samnite Period since this age "corresponds to the Samnite Era." (page 88)
This periodization is derived from Fiorelli (http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/6411737), who first divided Pompeian building into phases but did not provide secure dating for any of them: "Fiorelli was the first to understand the need for a historical division of Pompeian construction, and proposed this first classification." (page 88)""" ;
