<http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0mrv3sjb63> a skos:Concept ;
    periodo:spatialCoverageDescription "Pompeii" ;
    dcelements:language "it" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-1/it> ;
    dcterms:source [ dcterms:isPartOf <http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/600657650> ;
            bibo:locator "page 90" ] ;
    dcterms:spatial <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q38> ;
    skos:altLabel "6° periodo"@it ;
    skos:editorialNote "Derived from Mau's building periods (http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrfrq35): \"...more complete is the Mau which divided the Pompeian building into main phases.\"(pages 88-89) \"These are the last 16 years of the city between two disasters, the earthquake of 63 and the tremendous Vesuvian eruption of 79: the last phase of the fourth style.\" (page 90) This refers to Mau's fourth wall painting style (http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p03xjrf63k3). " ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0mrv3s> ;
    skos:note """"...più completo il Mau che suddivise l'edilizia pompeiana in fasi principali." (pages 88-89) 
"Sono gli ultimi 16 anni della città compresi fra due disastri, quello tellurico del 63 e la tremenda eruzione vesuviana del 79: ultime fase del IV stile." (page 90) """ ;
    skos:prefLabel "6° periodo" ;
