    skos:altLabel "Età calcarea"@it,
        "I Fase"@it ;
    skos:editorialNote "Translates to \"Phase I\" and \"Limestone Age.\" Dates are derived from the dates Maiuri gives for the Pre-Samnite/Oscan Period, since this period \"coincided with the Pre-Samnite one.\" (page 88) This periodization is derived from Fiorelli (http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/6411737), who first divided Pompeian building into phases but did not provide secure dating for any of them: \"Fiorelli was the first to understand the need for a historical division of Pompeian construction, and proposed this first classification.\" (page 88)" ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0mrv3s> ;
    skos:note """"I Fase - Età calcarea che faceva coincidere con quella presannitica." (page 88)
"Per primo il Fiorelli comprese la necessità di una divisione storica della edilizia pompeiana, e propose questa prima classificazione." (page 88)
""" ;
    skos:prefLabel "I Fase" ;
