    skos:note """A) 1.65-1.53 Ma, spheroids, small flake tools, B) 1.53-1.2 Ma, and small percentage of bifacially flaked tools, shaping of anvils, more LCTs, C) 1.2-1.0 Ma, more percussion tools, variable bifaces.

