    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0s2rwk> ;
    skos:note "Late Acacus characterized by groups with diversified extractive economy, almost exclusive mountain environment settlement pattern and semi-residential occupation. These indicate a reduced mobility and a more intensive exploitation of the local environment, in comparatively more arid conditions, starting ca. 8500 BP (Vernet AAR 2003 review of Garcea 2001)." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Late Acacus" ;
