    skos:note """Earliest Upper Paleolithic in Eurasia.

Middle Paleolithic to Upper Paleolithic transitional industry, e.g., Emiran.""" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Initial Upper Paleolithic" ;
    time:intervalFinishedBy [ skos:prefLabel "40000 BP2000" ;
