    skos:altLabel "Third Plague Pandemic"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0s5mgk> ;
    skos:note "\"The Third Plague Pandemic began with new plague activity in southeast China in the 17th or 18th century. These new strains then emerged out of Yunnan Province in the mid-19th century and spread globally via steamships, starting in 1894 out of Hong Kong.\" Note the global start date of 1894; previous incidence is limited to China." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Third Plague Pandemic" ;
