    skos:inScheme <http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0kh9ds> ;
    skos:note "This period follows on from the Neolithic and is characterized by the increasing use of Bronzework. It is subdivided in the Early, Middle and Late Bronze Age. Circa -2600 BCE to -700 BCE." ;
