<http://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p0trc5r> a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    dcterms:source [ dcterms:isPartOf <http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/43853631> ;
            bibo:locator "vii–ix" ] ;
    skos:editorialNote "These are the primary Pecos periods (Basketmaker II – Pueblo III) as derived from the 1999 Colorado \"context document.\" Being part of the Colorado contexts, these periods are specific to southwestern Colorado; however, they have been generally applied across the Four Corners region and broader San Juan basin. Period definitions are given at the title of each chapter of the Contexts; the \"locator within source\" points to the table of contents." .

