                [ foaf:name "Carlin, Neil" ] ;
            dcterms:issued "2022" ;
            dcterms:title "Archaeological periods for the island of Ireland" ] ;
    skos:editorialNote """This is not considered a definitive periodization of the archaeology of Ireland, but rather a tool to be developed for the standardisation across heritage inventories that cover the island of Ireland, and the C14 project undertaken by University College Dublin. Temporal boundaries have not been taken from any one source. Each of the Irish partners has provided a list of boundaries used in their inventories. These have been collated to come up with generic boundaries.

The periods list is used to reconcile named periods to date ranges in the ARIADNEplus project""" .

