    skos:editorialNote """Historic England Periods is a key guide for dating Britain's historic sites and monuments. The list is made available via the Forum on Information Standards in Heritage (FISH - see https://heritage-standards.org.uk/chronology/). The data has subsequently been converted to SKOS RDF format and published as Linked Open Data at http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_period
Two significant updates to the originally published list (May 2024 and February 2026) have been reflected in this dataset.""" .

