    skos:editorialNote """Andrew Kandel who has provided the period data is a member of the team undertaking the The Role of Culture in Early Expansions of Humans (ROCEEH) project. The data originates from the ROCEEH Out of Africa Database (ROAD). Sarah Wurz provided the Afrikaans period labels.

ROCEEH deals with the time from ca. 3 million to 20,000 before present. The periods in this authority reflect accepted cultural entities, which ROCEEH calls ArchStrats. The age ranges are approximate and based on publications and ROCEEH's own interpretations. 
""" .

